Description: Run the macOS Roblox client on Linux through Darling
 Mac O' Blox provides a GTK launcher and compatibility shims for the macOS
 Roblox player. The package includes prebuilt shims, desktop shortcuts and
 Roblox link handlers. Roblox itself is downloaded on first setup.
 .
 A full Darling installation, including GUI frameworks and stubs, is required.
